  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "The mass of zinc produced by the electrolysis of zinc sulphate solution with a steady current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>015</mn><mo> </mo><mi>A</mi></math> for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math> minutes is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>_</mo><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math>. (Atomic mass of zinc <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>amu</mi><mo>)</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "46",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given, t = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn><mo> </mo></math>min</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Zn</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>⟶</mo><mi>Zn</mi></math></p><p>Quantity of charge passed (Q) =Current in amperes ×Time in seconds.<br/>=<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>015</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>Gram equivalent mass of zinc = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>65</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math>g<br/>Now,  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>96500</mn></math> C of charge deposit zinc =<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>32</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn></math> g<br/><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math> C charge will deposit zinc = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>96500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>)</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>57</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>75</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mi>gm</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
